  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Beach Bordeaux<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Welcome to your perfect getaway in Santa Rosa Beach, FL! This charming house is designed for families and adventure seekers alike, offering a delightful blend of comfort and convenience. With a spacious layout that includes a king bed and twin bed, this home is ideal for families, and it’s dog-friendly too, so your furry friends can join in on the fun!<br><br><br><br>Step outside to enjoy the beautiful Florida weather on the expansive deck or patio, complete with comfortable furniture and a gas grill for those perfect BBQ evenings. Take a dip in the refreshing pool and unwind after a day of beachcombing and exploring the nearby attractions. With beach access just steps away, you can easily spend your days swimming, snorkeling, or simply soaking up the sun.<br><br><br><br>Inside, you'll find a fully equipped kitchen featuring modern appliances, including a fridge, stove, oven, and dishwasher, making meal prep a breeze. The living room is perfect for family game nights or movie marathons with Netflix streaming available. Plus, with amenities like central AC, WiFi, and a washer/dryer, you’ll have all the comforts of home during your stay.<br><br><br><br>Located near local restaurants, shopping, and outdoor activities like kayaking and deep-sea fishing, this Santa Rosa Beach house is the ultimate vacation destination. Book your stay today and create unforgettable memories in this beautiful coastal paradise!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Scenic beachside retreat with abundant space and smooth access to the shore"
